"An Avowed can share Contract Verified Information: rank, overall level, skills, spells and stats."
"Profiles are used to apply to schools and jobs."
"A profile lists commendations, recommendations and merits, such as an Emergency Response Merit."
"A commendation shows as a star after the Avowed's level."
"Summoners see a separate version: a long manual of numbers and magical codes."
"The summoner version lists several rank measures, including Earth B and a Priority Rank."
"Priority Rank is a huge, shifting number ranking importance among all Triplanetary subjects."
